   "source": [
    "# 16. AUTHENTICATION CREDENTIALS AND IDLE CLIENTS"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "02a65cb0-0bc2-4e9d-8184-45f3668e5d66",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "HTTP clients may retain authentication credentials for a long\n",
    "period of time.\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "1. AUTHENTICATION CREDENTIALS\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Authentication credentials are information used to prove\n",
    "the identity of a user.\n",
    "\n",
    "Examples:\n",
    "\n",
    "    Username + Password\n",
    "    Authentication tokens\n",
    "    Session credentials\n",
    "\n",
    "A client may keep these credentials so that the user does\n",
    "not have to authenticate repeatedly.\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "2. SECURITY ISSUE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "If a client remains unused for a long time, stored\n",
    "authentication information may remain available.\n",
    "\n",
    "HTTP/1.1 does not provide a general mechanism for a server\n",
    "to tell a client:\n",
    "\n",
    "\"Delete your stored authentication credentials.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "3. IDLE CLIENT\n",
    "\n",
    "An idle client is a client that has not made requests or\n",
    "performed activity for a certain period.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "User logs in\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "Client becomes inactive\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "Long period of no activity\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "Credentials may still be retained\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "4. SECURITY MEASURES\n",
    "\n",
    "To reduce the risk:\n",
    "\n",
    "    • Use session timeouts\n",
    "    • Expire inactive sessions\n",
    "    • Protect stored credentials\n",
    "    • Require re-authentication when appropriate\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "MEMORY TRICK\n",
    "\n",
    "Authentication credentials → Prove identity\n",
    "\n",
    "Idle client → No activity for a period\n",
    "\n",
    "Main issue → Credentials may remain available\n",
    "\n",
    "Protection → Timeout / expire inactive sessions"
   ]
  }
 ],
